# Extend Interview — Behavioral Story Bank

## Botify: SEO Revenue Recovery

### Situation
A retail client experienced roughly a 15–20% year-over-year decline in organic search revenue following the COVID-era surge.

### Analysis
I investigated the funnel and found declines in rankings and crawling. I segmented performance by page type, page age, and crawl depth.

The analysis identified roughly 100 newer product-detail pages that were buried about seven clicks deep and were not being crawled effectively.

### Recommendation
I recommended improving internal linking so the affected pages were reachable within roughly two to three clicks.

### Interview Themes
- Root-cause analysis
- Working with ambiguous performance declines
- Turning technical analysis into an actionable recommendation
- Communicating findings to stakeholders

