## Botify: SpeedWorkers Executive Recommendation

### Situation
During a QBR with the CMO of a hardware retailer, site rendering and crawl efficiency were limiting organic-search performance.

### Action
I explained crawl budget and rendering constraints in business terms and introduced SpeedWorkers as a potential solution.

### Result
The client purchased the product. Rendering performance improved substantially, and the client later experienced approximately 10% year-over-year organic revenue growth.

### Interview Themes
- Executive communication
- Translating technical concepts
- Influencing a business decision
- Connecting analysis to business impact

