## Proxify: Marketing Channel Efficiency

### Situation
New-client revenue was down roughly 15% during a quarter in which the team was investing substantial sales effort in Microsoft-suite leads.

### Analysis
Microsoft-suite leads represented roughly 30% of leads and consumed about 60 hours of sales-rep time, but converted at approximately 0.5%, compared with roughly 10% for other leads.

### Action
I surfaced the discrepancy to my manager and discussed it with marketing.

### Result
Marketing clarified that the channel was an experiment, and the teams aligned on using different channels for future testing.

### Interview Themes
- Challenging an inefficient process with data
- Cross-functional communication
- Resource allocation
- Constructive disagreement

