## NLP News Categorization: Data Cleaning and Modeling

### Situation
I worked with roughly 250,000 news articles spanning more than 36 original categories.

### Approach
I consolidated the target into eight broader categories and built a TF-IDF and LightGBM classification pipeline.

During validation, I identified roughly 20,000 duplicate or archived stories that redirected to home pages and removed them.

### Result
The model achieved approximately:
- Mean accuracy: 0.787
- Macro-F1: 0.738

### Interview Themes
- End-to-end analytical work
- NLP and classification
- Data cleaning
- Model evaluation beyond accuracy

