## MLB Analytics Platform: Grain and Data Modeling

### Situation
I built an MLB analytics pipeline using API data, Python, Snowflake, SQL, and Tableau.

### Challenge
An early version created aggregation errors because tables at different grains were being combined incorrectly.

### Action
I redesigned the warehouse around a clearer star schema and explicitly separated team-game, player-game batting, and player-game pitching facts.

### Interview Themes
- End-to-end project ownership
- ETL and data modeling
- SQL grain
- Debugging analytics systems
- Designing data for BI consumption

